Package: mmgsemGUI
Title: A Point-and-Click Interface for Mixture Multigroup Structural Equation Modeling
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Package", "Maintainer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: A graphical user interface for the 'mmgsem' package (Perez Alonso,
    Vermunt, Rosseel, Zhao & De Roover, 2026, <doi:10.1080/10705511.2026.2617170>).
    It guides the user through a Mixture Multigroup SEM analysis: loading the
    data, estimating the measurement model, defining the structural model,
    choosing the number of clusters, inspecting the clusters and testing
    hypotheses. Every analysis can be exported as a reproducible R script.
    All estimation is done by 'mmgsem' and 'lavaan'; this package only adds
    the interface, background execution, diagnostics and graphics.
